{
  "id": "RAW_1dde60cb0c",
  "title": "字节类 Muse 产品「小豆」最高年费 6088 元；Anthropic 跌破发行价...｜新皮层晚报",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkwNDQ5MjM1Mw==&mid=2247496013&idx=2&sn=1a207cd16b8b8735554e987112079141",
  "date": "2026-11-24 20:27:00",
